I tired doing that but it errors out, seems like dynamo_export is still in beta ;-;
Also, opened an [issue ](https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/133785) in pytorch.

@OPHoperHPO 

Haah, thanks catching my little blunder ;-;
The onnx model is indeed giving similar outputs 🙌 

Big big thanks for your help!
